# Local install

The user's running copy is `build/Game Mode Bar.app`.

After changes to Swift native code, controller/core, or build scripts, run:

`bun run install:local`

Do this before ending the task. Do not only run `build:debug` unless the user asks for the raw debug binary.

Keep the status-item UI as a native `NSMenu`. No custom popover panels unless the user explicitly requests them.
